# Cargo's scratch for the POSIX boundary. The shipped artifact is NOT here —
# §25.8 commits it per target under native/*/lib/<triple>/, so a plain checkout
# runs everything without a Rust toolchain, and CI rebuilds and compares it.
native/*/target/
